# ~/.ai-keys  -  your personal AI API keys
#
# Copy this file to your home folder as .ai-keys and paste your own keys in.
# Do NOT edit ~/.bashrc - this file is all you need.
#
#     cp /usr/local/share/ai-toolkit/ai-keys.template ~/.ai-keys
#     nano ~/.ai-keys
#     chmod 600 ~/.ai-keys
#     ai status
#
# Rules:
#   - one key per line, KEY=value, no spaces around the =
#   - no quotes needed
#   - lines starting with # are ignored
#   - get YOUR OWN keys. The free limits are per account, so a shared key
#     means the whole class runs out at the same moment.
#
# You do not need all of them. One is enough to start. Two is comfortable.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# START HERE - these two cover almost everything. A minute each, no card.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. GROQ - fastest free inference; answers nearly every question
#    30/min, ~1000/day per model
#    https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

# 2. MISTRAL - powers `ai fix`; enormous monthly volume
#    ~1/sec, ~1B tokens/month
#    NOTE: the free tier may train on what you send it
#    https://console.mistral.ai/api-keys
MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ADD THESE LATER - each one covers a gap the others do not
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 3. NVIDIA - no daily limit at all; the backstop when others run dry
#    40/min, latency varies (1-58s measured)
#    https://build.nvidia.com/
NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# 4. GOOGLE AI STUDIO - only 20 requests/DAY, but reads 1M-token files.
#    Keep it for `ai bigfile.log what broke`, not for chat.
#    https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# 5. COHERE - a different model family; good for a second opinion
#    20/min, 1000/month (about 33/day)
#    https://dashboard.cohere.com/api-keys
COHERE_API_KEY=

# 6. OPENROUTER - ~15 models behind one key; useful when a model disappears
#    20/min, 50/day total across all free models
#    https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# 7. CEREBRAS - 1M tokens/day but only 5 requests/min: a few big prompts
#    If you get "402 Payment required", activate the free tier in the
#    billing tab of your Cerebras dashboard.
#    https://cloud.cerebras.ai/
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Others the tool also supports (leave blank unless you want them)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GitHub Models - needs a FINE-GRAINED token with the "Models" permission.
# A classic ghp_ token returns 401.
# https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Cloudflare Workers AI - needs BOTH of these
# https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Privacy note
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mistral's free tier may train on what you send it. That is fine for
# "how do I list files", but do not paste unpublished research data.
# To turn it off entirely, delete the MISTRAL_API_KEY line above.
